rt the video tag.</video></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island><p><strong>AMD RDNA™2</strong> architecture is the foundation for next-generation PC gaming graphics, the highly anticipated <strong>PlayStation® 5</strong> and <strong>Xbox Series X</strong> consoles. The groundbreaking <strong>RDNA™</strong> architecture was first introduced at E3 2019, and since then has continuously evolved to spearhead the next generation of high performance gaming. It’s the DNA that powers your games, the DNA that brings your games to life, the DNA that keeps evolving.</p> </div> </div>
<div class="text-left mb-4"><h2 class="leading-none! text-[#868686]! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">Developer tools</h2><h2 class="leading-none! text-[#C2C2C2]! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">are in our</h2><h2 class="leading-none! text-(--color-text-button)! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">DNA</h2></div>
<p>The <strong>Radeon™ Developer Tool Suite</strong> comes fully loaded with everything you need to start working with the <strong>RDNA™2</strong> architecture. </p>
<a data-slot="/tools/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out cursor-pointer disabled:bg-[var(--color-gray-400)] aria-disabled:bg-[var(--color-gray-400)] button font-p text-[var(--color-text-button)] border border-[var(--color-button-border)] 
    bg-[var(--color-button-primary-bg)] hover:bg-[var(--color-button-primary-bg-hover)] 
    hover:text-[var(--color-text-button-hover)] rounded-[2px] px-[34px] py-4 no-underline m-0 gap-4 
    [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[var(--color-text-button)] 
    hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[var(--color-text-button-hover)] 
    [&amp;&gt;a]:text-[var(--color-text-button)] 
    hover:[&amp;&gt;a]:text-[var(--color-text-button-hover)] button w-full sm:w-auto" href="/tools/">Discover the Radeon™ Developer Tool Suite today</a>
<div data-theme="black" class="stripe stripe-full bg-[var(--color-stripe,var(--color-bg))] text-[var(--color-text)] vertical text-center astro-atossrk5"> <div class="stripe-inner astro-atossrk5">  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"> <p> <img src="/images/ultimate.Dx8nMTWb.png" alt width="487" height="484" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p><div class="text-right"><h2 class="leading-none! text-[#868686]! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">The perfect</h2><h2 class="leading-none! text-[#C2C2C2]! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">companion for</h2><h2 class="leading-none! text-white! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">DirectX®12 Ultimate</h2><div class="text-right flex md:flex-col flex-wrap gap-4 mt-4"><p><strong>RDNA2</strong> architecture comes with full support for <strong>DirectX®12 Ultimate</strong>. This includes <strong>raytracing</strong>, <strong>mesh shaders</strong>, <strong>variable rate shading,</strong> and <strong>sampler feedback</strong>.</p><a data-slot="/directx12-ultimate/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out cursor-pointer disabled:bg-[var(--color-gray-400)] aria-disabled:bg-[var(--color-gray-400)] button font-p text-[var(--color-text-button)] border border-[var(--color-button-border)] 
    bg-[var(--color-button-primary-bg)] hover:bg-[var(--color-button-primary-bg-hover)] 
    hover:text-[var(--color-text-button-hover)] rounded-[2px] px-[34px] py-4 no-underline m-0 gap-4 
    [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[var(--color-text-button)] 
    hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[var(--color-text-button-hover)] 
    [&amp;&gt;a]:text-[var(--color-text-button)] 
    hover:[&amp;&gt;a]:text-[var(--color-text-button-hover)] button w-full sm:w-auto" href="/directx12-ultimate/">Explore the features of DirectX®12 Ultimate</a></div></div> </div> </div> </div>
<div class="text-left mb-4"><h2 class="leading-none! text-[#868686]! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">Full support for</h2><h2 class="leading-none! text-[#C2C2C2]! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">all members of the</h2><h2 class="leading-none! text-(--color-text-button)! text-[64px]! font-normal! m-0!" style="font-family: Klavika, sans-serif;">AMD FidelityFX family</h2></div>
<p>Our flagship set of shader-based effects are all available right now for products based on <strong>AMD</strong> <strong>RDNA™ 2</strong> architecture. Check out the newest members of the family, built from the ground up with <strong>AMD</strong> <strong>RDNA™ 2</strong> architecture in mind.</p>
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QHTqrGwH95s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><p> <img src="/images/hangar21-preview.Bkrc1mOt.jpg" alt width="850" class="mx-auto" height="465" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p></a>
